      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0002",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0009",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "While Cinematic Video capture is enabled, you are not permitted to change your device’s focus mode, and any attempt to do so results in an `NSInvalidArgumentException`.",
      "normalizedSource": "While Cinematic Video capture is enabled, you are not permitted to change your device’s focus mode, and any attempt to do so results in an `NSInvalidArgumentException`.",
